cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165685179,"discussion_id":"05b6225d9362083c43e7e346acddbc9ddfaa686c","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复了EmbeddingDenseGradV2算子在核间梯度累加处理流程中潜在的同步问题。具体而言，在检查核间是否存在相同索引的`CheckHasSameIndices`函数中，原逻辑存在因硬件指令流水线导致的数据一致性问题，可能引发未定义行为，影响梯度累加结果的正确性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n在`CheckHasSameIndices`函数的关键位置，增加了对硬件事件`HardEvent::V_S`的同步操作。通过在向量比较结果转换为标量统计值之前，插入`SetFlag`和`WaitFlag`调用，强制等待向量计算单元到标量计算单元的数据传输完成，从而确保了后续`ScalarGetCountOfValue`统计所使用的数据是完全就绪的，从根本上解决了潜在的竞态条件。","created_at":"2026-03-18T23:33:35+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-18T23:33:35+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165685387,"discussion_id":"3019c2a5807f1699ec1a71762327989449907ad5","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-03-18T23:45:09+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-18T23:45:09+08:00","user":{"id":"6822d20d59bdd61f837dc0fd","login":"liuguoyue","object_id":"6822d20d59bdd61f837dc0fd","name":"liuguoyue","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/liuguoyue"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165685415,"discussion_id":"20ec2050cb070f4f25b50bd2042b9fdf6c843b88","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=b582e6c0e2c54a3f8168601c5b292c24&pipelineRunId=8334b31baff14a7b8d0617e99140b8ba&projectName=CANN'>8334b31baff14a7b8d0617e99140b8ba</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下载链